    "methodology_summary": "The study develops a copula-based pairs trading strategy on cointegrated cryptocurrency pairs using a reference asset (BTCUSDT) and 19 altcoins. Cointegration is evaluated using both linear Engle-Granger (EG) and non-linear Kapetanios-Shin-Snell (KSS) unit-root tests, and pairs are ranked using Kendall's Tau correlation coefficients to select the top pairs each week. Spreads are modeled and transformed using probability integral transforms, fitted to candidate distributions and copulas (selected via AIC), and trading signals are generated based on conditional copula probabilities.",
